1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:11,026
gCaptain reports that container spot freight rates fell again as extra vessel capacity and softer demand put pressure on major east-west routes.

2
00:00:10,976 --> 00:00:18,094
The trend suggests shipping lines may face a weaker market after months of disruption and high costs.

3
00:00:18,094 --> 00:00:26,285
For importers, lower rates can reduce transport costs, but unstable routes still make planning difficult.

